  "sourceNote": "The map joins the open 1990–2023 disposal-rate table to the reusable Statistics Canada census-division boundary already held by BC Data Mapper. Comox Valley and Strathcona report one combined waste stream, so their shared rate is drawn on both boundaries. Stikine has no reported 2023 rate. Historic values before 2012 are not directly comparable because collection methods changed.",
